          %p (…)
          #DeRhamDifferentialAsMorphismOfSmoothSpacesInEachDegree.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_3 Proposition
            %p
              For each
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi n
                    %mo ∈
                    %mi ℕ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n \in \mathbb{N}
              the de Rham differential of def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#DeRhamDifferentialInGeneralDegreeOverCartesianSpaces"}
              constitutes a homomorphism of smooth spaces
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi d
