                    \\,.
          %p
            In particular the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derivative"} derivative
            of a smooth function
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi f
                  %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                  %mi X
