          %h4#synthetic_differential_geometry Synthetic differential geometry
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+differential+geometry"} synthetic differential geometry
          %p
            We have two
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/full+and+faithful+functors"} full and faithful functors
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi CartSp
                  %mo ↪
